This package is a Blood Sweat Code fork of
@dylankenneally/react-native-ssh-sftp 1.9.0.

Project-owned changes:

- OpenSSH known_hosts trust-on-first-use and pinned SHA256 host-key verification
  on Android.
- Structured unknown-host and changed-host errors.
- Negotiated host-key type and SHA256 fingerprint returned on connect.
- Opt-in base64 raw shell output events and PTY resize support on Android.

The original upstream license and attribution are preserved in LICENSE.
